  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> moderate Weather; <strong>CL</strong> 5th<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> shoulders; <strong>Price</strong> 30,000 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> 2 lbs.</p>\n<p>Greater cloaks of weather resistance allow the bearer to treat all types of weather as two steps less severe.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nCraft Apparatus, Weather sphere (Clear Skies (mantle, all)); <strong>Cost</strong> 15,000 gp</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/apparatuses#toc15\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": "<p>Reviewed profile: greater cloak; all weather types.</p><p>Treat all weather types as two severity steps lower for the bearer, without changing the actual scene or other creatures' weather. Source publishes moderate aura with CL five; PF1 derives faint at this CL. Both facts are retained under issue #31; no invented caster level, spell school or corrected aura is substituted.</p>",
